gel, ethyl acetate/hexane, 3:7 v/v) was needed. 2, 4-dinitrophenyl
morpholine-4-carbodithioate (18). Yield 80-95%. Mp 149-151°C; 1HNMR
(CDCl3): δ(ppm) 8.85 (d, 1H, J= 2.44Hz), 8.45 (dd, 1H, J= 6.16Hz), 7.91
(d, 1H, J= 8.64 Hz), 4.29(t, 2H, J= 4.48 Hz), 4.09 (t, 2H, J=4.48 Hz),
3.84 (t, 4H, J=4.48 Hz) 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ(ppm) 190.94, 151.56, 148.19,
139.56, 134.38, 127.38, 120.47, 66.28, 52.06. HRMS: [M+H]+ = 330.02048
