gel, ethyl acetate/hexane, 3:7 v/v) was needed. 2,4-dinitrophenyl
benzylmethylcarbamodithioate (26). Yield 80-95%. Mp 124-125°C; 1HNMR
(CDCl3): δ(ppm) 8.78 (d, 1H, J=2.98Hz), 8.36(dd, 1H, J=6.21Hz), 7.87(d,
1H, J=8.54Hz), 7.35-7.22 (m, 5H), 5.25 (s, 2H), 5.09(s, 2H), 3.35 (s,
3H). 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ(ppm) 192.84, 191.35, 151.94, 151.54, 148.29,
148.14, 140.29, 139.86, 134.95, 134.65, 134.52, 133.96, 129.30, 129.01,
128.58, 128.26, 127.91, 127.15, 126.56, 120.48, 120.41, 59.91, 59.50,
43.75, 40.15 . HRMS: [M+H]+ = 364.04102
